{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297080","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297080","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1029708001:1":{"text":"I'm all set! Carts and guards for the caravan are ready, and I've even prepared some test goods for sale.","source_cn":"我这边行李已经收拾完了，商队需要的马车和护卫也都置办完...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA59F2E8D3443CD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1029708001":{"text":"I'm all set! Carts and guards for the caravan are ready, and I've even prepared some test goods for sale.","source_cn":"我这边行李已经收拾完了，商队需要的马车和护卫也都置办完成，还准备了一部分试销的货物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA59F2E8D3443CD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029708002:1":{"text":"Yep. No clue what the market looks like out there, and the desert's not exactly forgiving. Better not to bring anything we don't need.","source_cn":"嗯，一方面是不知道货品销路，另一方面也是听说沙漠比较艰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A5EBA75DFDAFBD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029708003:1":{"text":"Plus, lighter carts mean faster getaways if we run into bandits... that's what my security guy said.","source_cn":"而且还有盗匪，如果车子轻便的话，至少逃跑也能快一点吧…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF180EEECE4F3C4C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029708006:1":{"text":"Rowan's plan is certainly ambitious, but he's being really careful too. It's quite impressive.","source_cn":"罗万的计划野心勃勃，但做事却是小心翼翼的呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC0BDDF98061D9D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029708007:1":{"text":"Ha! Gotta aim high if you want the budget approved. But when it comes to execution, it's better to play it safe.","source_cn":"哈哈哈，毕竟计划要铺得大一点才能获批拿到预算嘛，但实际...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x593D1B155B0BF9A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029708008:1":{"text":"Let's get going!","source_cn":"没什么问题的话，我们这就出发吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55AF96964705368E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029708009:0":{"text":"Next stop: the Ashen Wastes!","source_cn":"目标——荒角沙漠！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2A4580576D2D61B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"Traveling light, huh?","source_cn":"真是轻车简从","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4EF86D950F27FEF6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Traveling light, huh?","female":"Traveling light, huh?","variant_male_record_index":"60078","variant_female_record_index":"60079","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029708004:1":{"text":"I'm not bringing much for the first trip. No point bringing a full shipment when we don't know what sells and what doesn't.","source_cn":"嗯，毕竟第一次去，也不知道货品的需求和销路，就当去试试水。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CB0AC81C51D929B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029708005:1":{"text":"Besides, I heard there are bandits in the area. If we get ambushed, I'd rather not hand over half a warehouse to them.","source_cn":"更何况那边听说还有盗匪出没，如果车载太多，万一战斗落入...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5ADCACAEFC95B4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:1:2":{"text":"That doesn't look like much.","source_cn":"货物好像不多？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE8438AD49F20864B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"That doesn't look like much.","female":"That doesn't look like much.","variant_male_record_index":"60080","variant_female_record_index":"60081","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:罗万":{"text":"Rowan","source":"罗万","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}